# Mahindra AI-SDLC Framework

This project uses the Mahindra AI-SDLC framework. All software development work follows structured, phase-based workflows stored in `.agents/`.

## Available Workflows

| Phase | Workflow File |
|-------|--------------|
| **Orchestrator** (start here) | `.agents/workflows/orchestrator.md` |
| Requirements & Planning | `.agents/workflows/requirements.md` |
| Architecture & Design | `.agents/workflows/design.md` |
| Feature Development | `.agents/workflows/development.md` |
| Testing (Jest / xUnit / Cypress) | `.agents/workflows/testing.md` |
| SOC / Security Review | `.agents/workflows/soc-review.md` |
| Azure DevOps CI/CD | `.agents/workflows/devops.md` |

